          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "The Statistics endpoints provide detailed analytics about your apps and organizations. You can track Monthly Active Users (MAU), storage usage, and bandwidth consumption across different time periods. This data is essential for monitoring app growth, resource usage, and planning capacity."
        }
